  - [1mC. A sidebar to the left of the table.[0m It squeezes a six-column table and has to stack on narrow screens.

  [1mI recommend B.[0m Failed sign-ins and security changes are one click away, and checking a single week costs only one
  extra click.

  Have a look and reply here. You can also click an option in the browser.

